note Click the command line at the bottom of the Output panel, type any CLI command (without the root) and press enter: it runs against the open index and map exactly as the CLI would, its output is appended to the log and the log scrolls to the end. A command that changes the map marks it unsaved instead of saving. 'clear' empties the log. Up and down recall earlier commands.

